  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Increasing Productivity &amp; Quality of Exports in High Value Sectors</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Focus on agricultural high value chains (E.g., Macadamia, spices, high value horticulture) to invest in management capacity and pilot new business approaches/products to improve access to productivity enhancing techniques, supply chain management value addition and take industry to scale.</narrative>
